# BuildKit reads <dockerfile>.dockerignore in preference to the context root's
# .dockerignore. That indirection is the whole point of this file: the repo root
# .dockerignore excludes internal/webui/frontend/dist/, which is precisely what
# this image is built to serve, so a build using the root list fails with a
# missing COPY source no matter how recently you ran `make build-frontend`.
#
# Ignore everything, then re-admit only the two paths the Dockerfile copies.
# Keeps the context to the SPA bundle instead of the whole repo.
*
!deploy/terraform/ui/Caddyfile
!internal/webui/frontend/dist
